            "content": "Run **`./check.sh`** in `monitoring_tkfe_daq/` on the Prometheus host - it walks the whole chain and names the broken hop.\n\n| Symptom | Where it breaks |\n|---|---|\n| **Scrape link = DOWN** | network, or `prometheus_exposer.py` is not running on the DAQ PC |\n| **Metrics file = MISSING** | exposer is up but pointed at a path the DAQ is not writing (`--metrics-file`) |\n| **Since last spill climbing** | DAQ process finished or wedged; the exposer keeps serving the last file |\n| **Everything empty, link UP** | wait one scrape interval, then check the `instance` picker at the top |\n\nCounters (`spills`, `triggers`, `words`) restart at 0 for every new DAQ run - that is expected, and `rate()` handles it."
